<gnaural_version>1.0.20110606</gnaural_version>
<title>Brain Machine Sleep</title>
<schedule_description>The sleep sequence starts out the same as the meditation sequence, but then keeps the brainwave frequencies at mostly Theta waves, with a little bit of Alpha, and with some pusling Delta.  This is enough to get you to drift off to sleep.</schedule_description>
<author>Mitch Altman</author>
